      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Use the `betaRecruitmentCriteria` resource to create public links with Device and OS criteria that help improve beta recruitment. Gain insights on the public-link performance from tester-event metrics, so you can modify the criteria set for the public, and enable or disable a public link.",
